### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:7001/health

### Get inventory for product 1
GET http://127.0.0.1:7001/inventory/1

### Reserve 2 units of product 1
POST http://127.0.0.1:7001/inventory/1/reserve
content-type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "order-1",
  "quantity": 2,
  "idempotencyKey": "order-1:1:2",
  "workflowId": "order-1"
}

### List proposals
GET http://127.0.0.1:7001/proposals

### Create reorder proposal directly
POST http://127.0.0.1:7001/proposals/reorder
content-type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 25,
  "workflowId": "order-2",
  "reason": "manual test proposal"
}
